  "description": "New to the Market – 2 x 2 Bedroom Semi-Detached Residences on c.1.72 Acres\nCaddlebrook, Corlis, Castlerea, Co. Roscommon\nGuide Price: €240,000\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional and highly versatile property comprising two 2-bedroom semi-detached two-storey residences, both maintained in excellent condition throughout.\n\nSet on a generous c.1.72 acre site, this property offers a rare opportunity to secure dual living accommodation with strong rental income potential, combined with a peaceful countryside setting and extensive outbuildings.\n\nAccommodation (Both Properties):\nGround Floor:\n\nLiving room with timber flooring, exposed timber beams, solid fuel stove with brick surround, fitted curtains and staircase to landing\n\nKitchen / dining area with solid timber flooring, timber beams, feature lighting, cream fitted kitchen with breakfast counter, 5-ring electric hob, double oven and grill\n\nFirst Floor:\nLanding with solid timber flooring\n\nBedroom 1: Double room with solid timber flooring and panel timber feature wall\n\nBedroom 2: Twin room with solid timber flooring\n\nMain bathroom: WC, WHB, fully tiled floor and walls, pumped shower (fully tiled) and skylight\n\nOutside & Grounds:\nc.1.72 acres of mature gardens and paddock\nPond feature adding to the natural setting\nTwo stables\nRange of outbuildings including:\nStorage sheds\nWorkshop\nMachinery/storage units\nChicken coop\nHardcore driveway with secure and private setting\nRainwater harvesting system\nServices & Features:\nOil-Fired Central Heating System\nPVC windows and doors\nMains water\nSeptic tank\n\nKey Features:\nTwo separate dwellings – ideal for rental income or multi-family living\nExcellent condition throughout\nTimber finishes and beams adding character\n\nExtensive site with paddock, pond and equestrian potential\nStrong investment and lifestyle opportunity\nPrivate, secure and peaceful setting\n\nLocation:\nLocated i